<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28-day t-bills yield up, 93-day unchanged.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-day t-bills yield up, 93-day unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills rose to 27.96 percent on Tuesday from 25.25 percent at the previous auction on February 18, a National Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills remained unchanged at 29.73 percent.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    Feb 25	   Feb 18</p>
<p> Issue volume		    3.00 million lei   4.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		   1,000 lei	1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		  1.91 million	 1.71 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		     1.2 million	  1.7 million</p>
<p> Yield			     27.96 pct	25.25 pct</p>
<p> Price			     97.9 pct	 98.1 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		   97.9-98.7 pct  98.1-99.0 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			  Mar 27, 1997   Mar 20, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				     Feb 25	   Feb 18</p>
<p> Issue volume		    24.00 million lei  14.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		   1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		  30.90 million     14.96 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		     13.00 million     12.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			     29.73 pct     29.73 pct</p>
<p> Price			     93.1 pct	93.1 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		   93.1-96.5     93.1-95.0 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			  May 29, 1997  May 22, 1997</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
